# Cavalry (2026-10-06, owner): horsemen kept back out of musket range, waiting for the moment -
# an enemy busy with someone else, an enemy with empty muskets, an enemy breaking - then the
# charge at the gallop, and back out to re-form if the charge fails. Ride down the running.
drill "Cavalry"
about "Horsemen kept out of musket range, waiting for the moment: an enemy busy with someone else, caught with empty muskets, or breaking - then the charge at the gallop. Rides down the running; pulls back to re-form when losing."
type Cavalry
dials aggression 0.80 discipline 0.60 cohesion 0.70 cover 0.00 patience 0.60 nerve 0.75

sergeant:
  when enemy breaking or enemy broken                  -> charge
  when enemy engaged elsewhere and enemy within 120    -> charge; form open
  when enemy reloading and enemy within 70             -> charge; form open
  when losing the exchange                             -> fall back 50
  when enemy within 110                                -> fall back 20; hold fire
  when enemy within 150                                -> hold; hold fire
  otherwise                                            -> advance; hold fire

man:
  when enemy running nearby and enemy within 60        -> charge
  when charging                                        -> charge
  when enemy within 6                                  -> charge
  otherwise                                            -> follow sergeant
